# RFC-TM-6 §4 (rfc-tm-6-diamond.md): goldens/live/ is regenerated by every
# `pnpm run test` from the flipped renderer — build output the classifier
# (check-golden-deltas.mjs) reads, not committed source. goldens/legacy-baseline/
# is the pinned, committed artifact; goldens/live/ never is.
lib/typed-mind-renderer/goldens/live/
